Third-party components
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project builds on, but does not redistribute, the following. Each remains
under its own license and its own copyright holders.

  Ultralytics YOLO            AGPL-3.0-only
    The detection pipeline (scripts/hailo_tespit.py, scripts/onnx_tespit.py,
    scripts/kamera_tespit.py) consumes models trained with Ultralytics YOLO and
    parses their output format. Ultralytics is AGPL-3.0; this project is
    licensed AGPL-3.0-only accordingly.
    https://github.com/ultralytics/ultralytics

  Hailo Dataflow Compiler / HailoRT / hailort-drivers
    Hailo AI proprietary and open-source components, per Hailo's own terms.
    derleme/ contains only our compilation recipe, not Hailo software.
    https://github.com/hailo-ai

  canonical/pi-ai-kit-ubuntu
    pi_kurulum/docker-compose.override.yaml is an override for this upstream
    project and does not modify or vendor it.
    https://github.com/canonical/pi-ai-kit-ubuntu

  ROS 2 Jazzy Jalisco          Apache-2.0
  Arduino ESP32 core           LGPL-2.1 / Apache-2.0

--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included in this repository
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

  * The PyQt ground-station interface, which was written by other members of
    the team and is their work, not ours.
  * Mechanical CAD models and drawings, which belong to the mechanical team.
  * Trained model weights and .hef binaries.
  * Calibration constants measured on the physical machine. Where a constant
    is required, the structure is present and the value is left at zero;
    how each one is measured is documented rather than the value itself.
  * Credentials, network addresses and host names, which are replaced with
    placeholders such as <TARET_IP>.
